{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t屯門輕鐵美樂站對開，早上有一輛貨車與一列無載客的輕鐵相撞，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n受意外影響，輕鐵服務一度受阻，部分輕鐵綫一度需要改道。港鐵表示，事件已經處理，輕鐵服務逐步回復正常。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.414268+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:14:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:24.807043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:06.956353+00:00","content_hash":"79df572a9e659960a41df3bfffb9fcb48ae8bda7f1bd30c153121e53dd8b38ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}